<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Admit Card - {{student.name}}</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        html,
        body {
            height: 100%;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            color: #1e293b;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 3mm 4mm;
            font-size: 11px;
            line-height: 1.35;
            -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact !important;
            print-color-adjust: exact !important;
            height: 297mm;
            width: 210mm;
        }

        @page {
            size: A4 portrait;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            height: calc(297mm - 16mm);
            border: 2px solid #1e3a8a;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        /* Header Layout */
        .header-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .header-table td {
            border: none;
            padding: 0;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }

        .logo-img {
            width: 26mm;
            height: 26mm;
            object-fit: contain;
        }

        .school-title {
            font-size: 37.5px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            color: #0d2873;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .school-subtitle {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 500;
            text-align: center;
            color: #475569;
            margin-top: -18px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .tagline-banner {
            margin: 6px auto 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 4px;
            max-width: 460px;
        }

        .tagline-text {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0d2873 0%, #061543 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 10px;
            padding: 3px 20px;
            clip-path: polygon(10px 0, calc(100% - 10px) 0, 100% 100%, 0 100%);
            letter-spacing: 0.4px;
        }

        .tagline-diamond {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            background: #eab308;
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .tagline-line {
            flex: 1;
            height: 1.5px;
        }

        .session-badge {
            background: #e0f2fe;
            border: 1px solid #7dd3fc;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 9.5px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0369a1;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        /* Admit Card Title Box */
        .title-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #0d2873 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(13, 40, 115, 0.2);
        }

        .title-main {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
        }

        .title-sub {
            font-size: 12.3px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #fef08a;
        }

        /* Student Details Box */
        .details-card {
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: #f8fafc;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .info-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        .info-table td {
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding: 2px 10px;
            font-size: 11px;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }

        .label-muted {
            font-size: 9px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #64748b;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 1px;
        }

        .value-bold {
            font-size: 11.5px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .photo-td {
            width: 30mm;
            height: 36mm;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3px !important;
            background: #ffffff;
        }

        .photo-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 6px;
            border: 1.5px solid #3b82f6;
        }

        /* Section Banner Header */
        .section-header {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12.5px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 5px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #2563eb 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0;
            margin-top: 3px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        /* Routine Tables */
        .routine-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 0 0 6px 6px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .routine-table th,
        .routine-table td {
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            padding: 4px 6px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 11.5px;
            line-break: strict;
        }

        .routine-table th {
            background: #f1f5f9;
            color: #1e3a8a;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .routine-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
        }

        .routine-table td.subject-col {
            text-align: left;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .sitting-header {
            color: #1e3a8a;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .sitting-timing {
            font-size: 10.5px;
            font-weight: 500;
            /*color: #475569;*/
            color: #d12b1f;
            text-transform: none;
            display: block;
            margin-top: 1px;
        }

        /* Instructions Box */
        .instructions-box {
            border: 1px solid #fde047;
            background: #fffbeb;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        .instructions-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 11px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #b45309;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .instructions-list {
            padding-left: 18px;
            font-size: 9px;
            color: #78350f;
            line-height: 1.45;
        }

        .instructions-list li {
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        /* Footer Signatures */
        .footer-signatures {
            margin-top: auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-end;
            padding: 10px 10px 4px 10px;
        }

        .sig-box {
            text-align: center;
            width: 130px;
            border-top: 2px solid #1e3a8a;
            padding-top: 4px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 10px;
            color: #1e3a8a;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- School Header -->
        <table class="header-table">
            <tr>
                {{!-- <td style="width: 18%;">
                    {{#if logoData}}
                    <img src="{{logoData}}" class="logo-img" alt="Logo">
                    {{/if}}
                </td> --}}
                <td style="width: 85%; text-align: center;">
                    <div
                        style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 5px; padding-right: 10px;">
                        <div>
                            {{#if logoData}}
                            <img src="{{logoData}}" class="logo-img" alt="Logo">
                            {{/if}}
                        </div>
                        <div class="school-title">{{school.name}}</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="school-subtitle">
                        Address : {{school.address}}<br>
                        Cont.: {{school.phone}}<br>
                        Email : {{school.email}} | Website : {{school.website}}
                    </div>
                    {{#if school.tagline}}
                    <div class="tagline-banner">
                        <div class="tagline-line" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #eab308);">
                        </div>
                        <div class="tagline-diamond"></div>
                        <div class="tagline-text">{{school.tagline}}</div>
                        <div class="tagline-diamond"></div>
                        <div class="tagline-line" style="background: linear-gradient(to left, transparent, #eab308);">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    {{/if}}



                </td>
                {{!-- <td style="width: 18%; text-align: right;">
                    <div class="session-badge">
                        Session<br><span style="font-size: 11px;">{{student.academic_year_name}}</span>
                    </div>
                </td> --}}
            </tr>
        </table>

        <!-- Admit Card Title Box -->
        <div class="title-box">
            <div class="title-main">{{exam_name}} Admit Card</div>
            <div class="title-sub">Academic Session {{student.academic_year_name}}</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Student Info Details -->
        <div class="details-card">
            <table class="info-table">
                <tr>
                    <td style="width: 45%;">
                        <span class="label-muted">Student's Name</span>
                        <span class="value-bold">{{student.name}}</span>
                    </td>
                    <td style="width: 25%;">
                        <span class="label-muted">Class</span>
                        <span class="value-bold">{{student.class_name}}</span>
                    </td>
                    <td style="width: 15%;">
                        <span class="label-muted">Roll No.</span>
                        <span class="value-bold">{{student.roll_no}}</span>
                    </td>
                    <td rowspan="2" class="photo-td">
                        {{#if student.avatar_url}}
                        <img src="{{student.avatar_url}}" class="photo-img" alt="Photo">
                        {{else}}
                        <div style="font-size: 8.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 15px; font-weight: 600;">PHOTO</div>
                        {{/if}}
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>
                        <span class="label-muted">Father's Name</span>
                        <span class="value-bold">{{student.fathers_name}}</span>
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        <span class="label-muted">Mother's Name</span>
                        <span class="value-bold">{{#if
                            student.mothers_name}}{{student.mothers_name}}{{else}}{{student.mother_name}}{{/if}}</span>
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        <span class="label-muted">Date of Issue</span>
                        <span class="value-bold">{{issueDate}}</span>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </div>

        <!-- Oral Examination Section (If Oral exists) -->
        {{#if hasOral}}
        <div class="section-header">Oral Examination</div>
        <table class="routine-table">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 20%;">Date</th>
                    <th style="width: 20%;">Day</th>
                    <th style="width: 60%; text-align: left; padding-left: 12px;">Subjects</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {{#each oralRoutine}}
                <tr>
                    <td><strong style="color: #1e3a8a;">{{this.date}}</strong></td>
                    <td>{{this.day}}</td>
                    <td class="subject-col" style="padding-left: 12px;">{{{this.subjects}}}</td>
                </tr>
                {{/each}}
            </tbody>
        </table>
        {{#if hasWritten}}<div style="margin-top: 6px;"></div>{{/if}}
        {{/if}}

        <!-- Written Examination Section -->
        {{#if hasWritten}}
        <div class="section-header">Written Examination</div>
        {{#if hasSittings}}
        <table class="routine-table">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 18%;">Date</th>
                    <th style="width: 18%;">Day</th>
                    <th style="width: 32%;">
                        <span class="sitting-header">1<sup>st</sup> Sitting</span>
                        <span class="sitting-timing">(Timing : {{firstSittingTiming}})</span>
                    </th>
                    <th style="width: 32%;">
                        <span class="sitting-header">2<sup>nd</sup> Sitting</span>
                        <span class="sitting-timing">(Timing : {{secondSittingTiming}})</span>
                    </th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {{#each writtenRoutine}}
                <tr>
                    <td><strong style="color: #1e3a8a;">{{this.date}}</strong></td>
                    <td>{{this.day}}</td>
                    <td style="font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a;">{{{this.sitting1}}}</td>
                    <td style="font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a;">{{{this.sitting2}}}</td>
                </tr>
                {{/each}}
            </tbody>
        </table>
        {{else}}
        <table class="routine-table">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 20%;">Date</th>
                    <th style="width: 20%;">Day</th>
                    <th style="width: 35%; text-align: left; padding-left: 12px;">Subject</th>
                    <th style="width: 25%;">Timing</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {{#each writtenRoutine}}
                <tr>
                    <td><strong style="color: #1e3a8a;">{{this.date}}</strong></td>
                    <td>{{this.day}}</td>
                    <td style="font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a; text-align: left; padding-left: 12px;">
                        {{{this.subject}}}
                    </td>
                    <td style="font-weight: 600; color: #475569;">{{this.time}}</td>
                </tr>
                {{/each}}
            </tbody>
        </table>
        {{/if}}
        {{/if}}

        <!-- Instructions Box -->
        <div class="instructions-box">
            <div class="instructions-title">General / Exam Instructions for Students</div>
            <ol class="instructions-list">
                <li>Reporting Timing : 7:45am and class 9th and 10th Reporting Timing : 10:00am</li>
                <li>Check the exam timetable carefully.</li>
                <li>Students must bring the 'Admit Card' and show it to the invigilator(s) on duty and should preserve
                    it for future requirements.</li>
                <li>Mobile Phone, Calculator, Digital Watch or any Electronic Device is <strong>NOT ALLOWED</strong>.
                </li>
                <li>Arrive at the school at least 15 minutes before the start of the examination.</li>
                <li>Students are barred from entering the examination hall 15 minutes after the written examination
                    starts.</li>
                <li>Ensure that you use the washroom before arriving for your exam as you will not be permitted to leave
                    during the first hour.</li>
                <li>Keep your eyes on your own paper. Remember, copying is cheating!</li>
                <li>You must remain silent until after you have exited the school building.</li>
            </ol>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer Signatures -->
        <div class="footer-signatures">
            <div class="sig-box">Signature of Guardian</div>
            <div class="sig-box">Class Teacher</div>
            <div class="sig-box">Exam Controller</div>
            <div class="sig-box">Principal</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>